{
 "name": "lucy_skeleton",
 "description": "Lucy (AL 288-1) partial skeleton laid out flat like the famous museum layout: about 40 percent of a small skeleton in cream-tan bone #e8d6a8, brown outline #6b4a22, #b89a6a shading; missing pieces simply absent. Cranial fragments (no face) at top, U-shaped mandible, both humeri (viewer's left one in two pieces, top end at (-95,-205) = red-arrow target), viewer's-left forearm, rib fragments, vertebrae with gaps, sacrum, left innominate, left femur, tibia and fibula pieces. Clean bone, no damage. Anchor centre, 420x700 (x -210..210, y -350..350). Use at 0.8 on a white card.",
